  "summary": "From a high Swan, the arms release and the body rocks forward onto the chest and back again, holding one long arch.",
  "steps": [
    "Lie face down, hands under the shoulders.",
    "Press up into a long back bend.",
    "Release the hands forward and rock onto the chest as the legs lift.",
    "Rock back onto the thighs as the chest rises; keep rocking.",
    "Catch with the hands to finish and sit back to rest."
